% arising from its use.

the target language is: lps.

the maximum time is 14.

the actions are:
    the move move with *a board*, *a thing*, *a second thing*, *a third thing* and *a fourth thing* is made; known as move.
    the move tick is made; known as tick.

the fluents are:
    *a board* cell *a file* with *a rank* with *a role*; known as cell.
    *a role* is a control; known as control.
    *a board* is played; known as played.
    *a thing* is a step; known as step.
    the goal of *a role* is *a number*; known as goal.
    the move move with *a board*, *a thing*, *a second thing*, *a third thing* and *a fourth thing* is legal; known as legal_move.
    the game is terminal; known as terminal.

the templates are:
    *a thing* whiteknightmove *a second thing* with *a third thing* with *a fourth thing*.
    *a thing* blackknightmove *a second thing* with *a third thing* with *a fourth thing*.
    *a thing* knightmove *a second thing* with *a third thing* with *a fourth thing*.
    the nextrank of *a thing* is *a second thing*.
    *a thing* is the nextfile of *a second thing*.
    the skiprank of *a thing* is *a second thing*.
    *a thing* is the skipfile of *a second thing*.
    the succ of *a thing* is *a second thing*.

the knowledge base parallelknightthrough includes:

the text of the game is at "sources/parallelknightthrough.hrf".

a thing whiteknightmove a second thing with a third thing with a fourth thing if
    the thing is the skipfile of the third thing
    and the nextrank of the second thing is the fourth thing.

a thing whiteknightmove a second thing with a third thing with a fourth thing if
    the third thing is the skipfile of the thing
    and the nextrank of the second thing is the fourth thing.

a thing whiteknightmove a second thing with a third thing with a fourth thing if
    the thing is the nextfile of the third thing
    and the skiprank of the second thing is the fourth thing.

a thing whiteknightmove a second thing with a third thing with a fourth thing if
    the third thing is the nextfile of the thing
    and the skiprank of the second thing is the fourth thing.

a thing blackknightmove a second thing with a third thing with a fourth thing if
    the thing is the skipfile of the third thing
    and the nextrank of the fourth thing is the second thing.

a thing blackknightmove a second thing with a third thing with a fourth thing if
    the third thing is the skipfile of the thing
    and the nextrank of the fourth thing is the second thing.

a thing blackknightmove a second thing with a third thing with a fourth thing if
    the thing is the nextfile of the third thing
    and the skiprank of the fourth thing is the second thing.

a thing blackknightmove a second thing with a third thing with a fourth thing if
    the third thing is the nextfile of the thing
    and the skiprank of the fourth thing is the second thing.

a thing knightmove a second thing with a third thing with a fourth thing if
    the thing whiteknightmove the second thing with the third thing with the fourth thing.

a thing knightmove a second thing with a third thing with a fourth thing if
    the thing blackknightmove the second thing with the third thing with the fourth thing.

the nextrank of 1 is 2.

the nextrank of 2 is 3.

the nextrank of 3 is 4.

the nextrank of 4 is 5.

the nextrank of 5 is 6.

the nextrank of 6 is 7.

the nextrank of 7 is 8.

"a" is the nextfile of b.

b is the nextfile of c.

the skiprank of 1 is 3.

the skiprank of 2 is 4.

the skiprank of 3 is 5.

the skiprank of 4 is 6.

the skiprank of 5 is 7.

the skiprank of 6 is 8.

"a" is the skipfile of c.

the succ of 1 is 2.

the succ of 2 is 3.

the succ of 3 is 4.

the succ of 4 is 5.

the succ of 5 is 6.

the succ of 6 is 7.

the succ of 7 is 8.

the succ of 8 is 9.

the succ of 9 is 10.

the succ of 10 is 11.

the succ of 11 is 12.

the succ of 12 is 13.

the succ of 13 is 14.

the succ of 14 is 15.

the succ of 15 is 16.

the succ of 16 is 17.

the succ of 17 is 18.

the succ of 18 is 19.

the succ of 19 is 20.

the succ of 20 is 21.

the move move with a board, a thing, a second thing, a third thing and a fourth thing is legal at a time if
    white is a control at the time
    and the board cell the thing with the second thing with white at the time
    and it is not the case that the board is played at the time
    and the thing whiteknightmove the second thing with the third thing with the fourth thing
    and it is not the case that the board cell the third thing with the fourth thing with white at the time.

the move move with a board, a thing, a second thing, a third thing and a fourth thing is legal at a time if
    black is a control at the time
    and the board cell the thing with the second thing with black at the time
    and it is not the case that the board is played at the time
    and the thing blackknightmove the second thing with the third thing with the fourth thing
    and it is not the case that the board cell the third thing with the fourth thing with black at the time.

the goal of white is 100 at a time if
    "a" cell a file with 8 with white at the time.

the goal of black is 100 at a time if
    c cell a file with 1 with black at the time.

the game is terminal at a time if
    "a" cell a file with 8 with white at the time.

the game is terminal at a time if
    c cell a file with 1 with black at the time.

the game is terminal at a time if
    21 is a step at the time.

when the move move with a board, a thing, a second thing, a third thing and a fourth thing is made
    and the board cell the thing with the second thing with a role
then the board cell the third thing with the fourth thing with the role
    and it is not the case that the board cell the thing with the second thing with the role.

when the move move with a board, a thing, a second thing, a third thing and a fourth thing is made
    and the board cell the third thing with the fourth thing with a role
then it is not the case that the board cell the third thing with the fourth thing with the role.

when the move move with a board, a thing, a second thing, a third thing and a fourth thing is made
then the board is played.

when the move tick is made
then it is not the case that "a" is played
    and it is not the case that b is played
    and it is not the case that c is played.

when the move tick is made
    and a thing is a step
    and the succ of the thing is a second thing
then the second thing is a step
    and it is not the case that the thing is a step.

when the move tick is made
    and white is a control
then black is a control
    and it is not the case that white is a control.

when the move tick is made
    and black is a control
then white is a control
    and it is not the case that black is a control.

it must not be true that
    the move move with a board, a thing, a second thing, a third thing and a fourth thing is made
    and it is not the case that the move move with the board, the thing, the second thing, the third thing and the fourth thing is legal.

