scenario play is:
    the move move with "a", "a", 1, b and 3 is made from 1 to 2.
    the move move with b, c, 1, b and 3 is made from 2 to 3.
    the move move with c, b, 1, "a" and 3 is made from 3 to 4.
    the move tick is made from 4 to 5.
    the move move with c, c, 7, b and 5 is made from 5 to 6.
    the move move with b, b, 7, c and 5 is made from 6 to 7.
    the move move with "a", c, 8, b and 6 is made from 7 to 8.
